Fixes #2195 

The bundled output from Kotlin/JS now gets the `Database` and `Statement` objects from the `sql.js` module rather than an undefined `SqlJs` qualifier/object.

Before:
```js
// ...
// Unrelated js code
}(this, function (_, initSqlJs, $module$_js_joda_core) {
  var Database = SqlJs.Database;
  var Statement = SqlJs.Statement;
// More module initialization code
// ...
```

After:
```js
// ...
// Unrelated js code
}(this, function (_, initSqlJs, $module$sql_js) {
  var Database = $module$sql_js.Database;
  var Statement = $module$sql_js.Statement;
// More module initialization code
// ...
```

